diff:1747306854:1747303645:=809,810c809,810%0a%3c '''$sdp.line''' - Read/Write reference to SDP body lines, with filtering support%0a%3c %0a---%0a> '''$sdp.line''' - Read/Write reference to the SDP body, in a per-line fashion, with filtering support%0a> %0a832,850d831%0a%3c [[#sdp.stream]]%0a%3c !!!! SDP body line - $sdp.stream [[#sdp.stream|&#x1F517;]]%0a%3c %0a%3c '''$sdp.stream''' - Read/Write reference to SDP body streams, with filtering support%0a%3c %0a%3c [@%0a%3c # Within a desired stream, you can first filter by line...%0a%3c $sdp.stream(/a=ptime);         # first “a=ptime” line from Stream #0 (any stream type)%0a%3c $sdp.stream([1]/a=ptime);      # first “a=ptime” line from Stream #1 (any stream type)%0a%3c $sdp.stream(audio[1]/a=ptime); # first “a=ptime” line from Audio ("m=audio...") Stream #1%0a%3c $sdp.stream(a[1]/a=ptime);     # first “a=ptime” line from Audio ("m=a...") Stream #1%0a%3c $sdp.stream(video[1]/a=nortpproxy) = NULL;  # delete entire line starting with "a=nortpproxy" from Video Stream #1%0a%3c $sdp.stream(v[1]/a=nortpproxy:/[0]) = “yes”;   # set first "a=nortpproxy" line "yes" value, in Video Stream #1%0a%3c %0a%3c # ... and, additionally, by token%0a%3c $sdp.stream(video[1]/a=fmtp:115/bitrate=) = 48000; # set "bitrate=" to 48000, under "a=fmtp:115" line #0, as part of Video Stream #1%0a%3c $sdp.stream(video[1]/a=fmtp:115[3]) = NULL; # delete the 4th occurrence (if any) of "a=fmtp:115" line, but only within Video Stream #1%0a%3c $sdp.stream(video[1]/a=fmtp:115/bitrate=) = 48000; # set "bitrate=" to 48000, under "a=fmtp:115" line #0, as part of Video Stream #1%0a%3c @]%0a
